  "prefLabel": "Phy 401.08 Direct personal supervision",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Phy 401.08 “Direct personal supervision” means supervision during which the supervisor is physically present in the room and observes, directs, and supervises tasks related to client management continuously throughout the time that the tasks are performed.\n\nSource. #9456, eff 4-17-09; renumbered by #10061 (from Phy 401.05); ss by #12088, eff 1-20-17",
